Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(inworld):=20=E2=9C=A8=20add=20opt-in=20spe?=
 =?UTF-8?q?aker=20and=20word=20timing=20metadata?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Preserve Inworld word timestamps and stream-scoped speaker labels through the official LiveKit speech events. Keep the default request and transcript behaviour unchanged and avoid assigning mixed or missing labels to one speaker.

Cover zero-valued speakers, absent or invalid timestamps, reconnection scope, Japanese and English text, partial results, and empty final events with provider-free fixtures.
